Haan. Image mein Star Schema dikh raha hai jisme centre mein fact_sales hai aur 4 dimension tables hain:

dim_customer
                      |
                      |
dim_product ---- fact_sales ---- dim_time
                      |
                      |
                 dim_location

Isko SQL mein banane ke liye pehle dimension tables, phir fact table create karna hoga.

Complete SQL

-- =========================================
-- 1. Customer Dimension
-- =========================================

CREATE TABLE dim_customer (
    customer_id INT PRIMARY KEY,
    customer_name VARCHAR(100),
    gender VARCHAR(10),
    city VARCHAR(50),
    state VARCHAR(50)
);


-- =========================================
-- 2. Product Dimension
-- =========================================

CREATE TABLE dim_product (
    product_id INT PRIMARY KEY,
    product_name VARCHAR(100),
    category VARCHAR(50),
    subcategory VARCHAR(50),
    price DECIMAL(10,2)
);


-- =========================================
-- 3. Time Dimension
-- =========================================

CREATE TABLE dim_time (
    time_id INT PRIMARY KEY,
    full_date DATE,
    day INT,
    month INT,
    quarter INT,
    year INT
);


-- =========================================
-- 4. Location Dimension
-- =========================================

CREATE TABLE dim_location (
    location_id INT PRIMARY KEY,
    city VARCHAR(50),
    state VARCHAR(50),
    country VARCHAR(50),
    region VARCHAR(50)
);


-- =========================================
-- 5. Sales Fact Table
-- =========================================

CREATE TABLE fact_sales (
    sales_id INT PRIMARY KEY,

    customer_id INT,
    product_id INT,
    time_id INT,
    location_id INT,

    quantity INT,
    sales_amount DECIMAL(10,2),
    discount DECIMAL(10,2),

    FOREIGN KEY (customer_id)
        REFERENCES dim_customer(customer_id),

    FOREIGN KEY (product_id)
        REFERENCES dim_product(product_id),

    FOREIGN KEY (time_id)
        REFERENCES dim_time(time_id),

    FOREIGN KEY (location_id)
        REFERENCES dim_location(location_id)
);

Isme actual relation kya hai?

fact_sales mein dimensions ki foreign keys hongi:

Fact Sales	Dimension

customer_id	dim_customer
